{"id":67330,"date":"2025-08-24T19:07:45","date_gmt":"2025-08-24T18:07:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67330"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:00:41","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:00:41","slug":"caminhada-trail-da-salamandra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/caminhada-trail-da-salamandra\/","title":{"rendered":"V Caminhada Trail da Salamandra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">V Caminhada Trail da Salamandra 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>V Caminhada Trail da Salamandra 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a <strong>7 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> na pitoresca Aldeia da Penina (Benafim, <strong>Loul\u00e9<\/strong>), o evento prop\u00f5e desafios de <strong>16 km<\/strong> e <strong>10 km<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de uma caminhada de <strong>4.5 km<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado explora os deslumbrantes trilhos da Paisagem Protegida Local da Rocha da Pena, um dos grandes tesouros ambientais e geol\u00f3gicos da serra algarvia.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Focada em dinamizar a pr\u00e1tica desportiva no interior algarvio, a prova \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa Unidos da Penina<\/strong>, contando com o forte envolvimento da comunidade local e promovendo um fim de semana de contacto puro com a natureza.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radiu