r-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 o local de partida da corrida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O local de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada do evento est\u00e1 situado no centro da Aldeia da Penina, na freguesia de Benafim (concelho de Loul\u00e9).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e de tr\u00eas vertentes: Trail Longo de 16 km, Trail Curto de 10 km e a Caminhada das Salamandrinhas com 4.5 km.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento est\u00e1 a cargo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa Unidos da Penina, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Loul\u00e9 e da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de T\u00f4r, Queren\u00e7a e Benafim.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o do evento, os resultados oficiais e os tempos dos atletas poder\u00e3o ser consultados no portal Portugal Running. As fotografias oficiais ser\u00e3o posteriormente partilhadas pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"V Caminhada Trail da Salamandra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Loul\u00e9, Faro\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Loul\u00e9\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A V Caminhada Trail da Salamandra realiza-se a 7 de Novembro. Consulta o regulamento, hor\u00e1rios de partida e percursos (16 km, 10 km). Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-caminhada-trail-da-salamandra.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/5-caminhada-trail-da-salamandra\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/5-caminhada-trail-da-salamandra\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada\", \"price\": \"5.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock